//! Dedicated unit, parity, and integration tests for Scene `GlobeSurfaceTile`.
//!
//! Validates parity against pinned CesiumJS 23.0.0 (`@cesium/engine` 23.0.0, CesiumJS 1.139)
//! fixture expectations generated by `tools/cesium/generate-scene-globe-surface-tile.mjs`.

